Package: RMB
Type: Package
Title: Analysis of Drosophila Activity Data from TriKinetics Monitors
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Yongjun Li
Maintainer: Yongjun Li <yjli@sas.upenn.edu>
Description: RMB provides tools for processing and analyzing Drosophila activity 
    data from TriKinetics multi-beam (MB) and single-beam (SB) monitors. The package 
    uses a custom MonitorS4 S4 class system for organizing behavioral data including 
    activity, sleep, and positional tracking. Features include automated data loading,
    comprehensive analysis functions, and HTML report generation.
